# Gemini API key — used ONLY server-side by the /api/gemini serverless function.
# No VITE_ prefix: it must never be exposed to the browser bundle.
# Local dev: put it in .env and run `vercel dev` (plain `vite dev` does not serve /api).
# Production: set it in Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
